'''Venusaur''' (Japanese: '''フシギバナ''' ''Fushigibana'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

